		{
			dependencies: ["178FC7958159A73B"]
			description: [
				"In the first days, you should focus on exploring and getting yourself equipped, as you'd normally do, and find somewhere nice to settle down."
				""
				"Once you settle down, you can begin making progress on making the tools needed to fight against the Horde."
				""
				"An important notice: Terra Immundus world's are much smaller than the average Minecraft world, being 6k by 6k blocks, later expanding to vanilla's size when defeating the horde."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:campfire"
			id: "5865797006BBAAE2"
