			description: [
				"Dynamos push energy to where they're facing, but to move power further and power multiple machines, you will need &6Energy Cables&r"
				""
				"Energy Cables move energy around. A &6Pipe Wrench&r is needed to configure the pipes, allowing to change the cable from the default mode (insert) to extract power, as well as toggling connections."
