			description: [
				"&lTerra Immundus&r is a &olow tech&r and &3Sculk Infection,&r modpack focused on being lightweight, concise and having extensive mod integration; All in one dimension."
				""
				"These will cover noteworthy pack features and changes and guide you through progression. All quests are optional. "
				""
				"&l&cQuests do not have rewards&r.&r"
				""
				"As per the standard of modded Minecraft, use &6JEI&r to see item recipes and uses."
				"While mousing over an item, press &l&6R&r&r to view the recipe, and &l&6U&r&r to see its uses."
